      {
        "id": 2836389,
        "name": "Geo Eclipse Oksaras",
        "username": "Geo_Eclipse_Oksaras",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/geo_eclipse_oksaras/{size}/500781_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-08T11:00:41.010Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I might be wrong here, but I don’t think every effect shows modifiers in the data.</p>\n<p>Some modules seem to just use the stats already on them and the effect is more like a switch that turns it on when active. That’s why stuff like afterburners or boosters can look inconsistent compared to things like missile guidance computers.</p>\n<p>And shipID kinda makes sense because the bonus is affecting the ship you’re sitting in, not the module itself, even though it looks weird when you’re digging through the files.</p>\n<p>Again, not a dev or anything — just how it looks from the player side.</p>",
